    "body": "We used an offline VM running a copy of our Agie Classic Cut 2S machine control. We imported both mixed line-and-arc DXF jobs. The plots preserved the R4 and R6 quarter-circle centres in one job and the three circular sweeps and oblique straight side in the other. Both passed FORMALCHECK with setup and option warnings.\n\nAll controller runs were offline. No physical cut was made.\n",
